{
  "$description": "Nook brand tokens. Moved unchanged from ui/app.css (light and dark); names follow the hq design kit where the role is the same (ink→text, ink-2→text-2, line-strong→line-2, accent-strong→accent-ink, bad→danger, serif→display), game colours keep their own names. Edit here, then run `node brand/tokens-css.mjs`. Standard: hq/standards/brand-book.md.",
